ames only README.md and architecture.md navigation; no mention of preserving anchors/section names the generator must emit, nor of the content-asserting tests."],"finding":"The plan converts the existing hand-authored docs/config.md into a byte-generated artifact but enumerates only docs/README.md and docs/architecture.md as consumers to update; it omits substantial in-repo consumers that depend on config.md's current content, section names, and anchors.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fe958603306cf82bc","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan step 2 / Outcome / Acceptance Criteria line 2 ('docs/README.md and docs/architecture.md navigation are updated')","norm_id":"n594d9baccb609dec","priority":0.8889,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Regenerated config.md renames or drops a section (e.g. 'Session provenance' or the [snapshot] block), breaking anchor links in AGENTS.md/reuse-surface.md/concurrency.md/event-schema.md and failing the content-asserting unit tests.","The generator omits an env-var name or the 'config key inventory' anchor, silently breaking existing deep links."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8889,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"omits_required_site","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"non